			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Setup: connect Tailscale on iPhone and select your home exit node. Enable Remote Login on the Mac. Set Host to its reachable LAN or Tailscale address and User to its short login name. Authorize the iPhone's public SSH key and install the helper. Test on cellular separately from home Wi-Fi. Tailscale stays enabled afterward. This only queues the link; it does not wait for audio conversion or phone sync.</string>
